WEBVTT

00:00:00.369 --> 00:00:10.609
Connect Claude, ChatGPT, Claude Code, or Cursor to Worklynq, and work from the conversation. In this video, you’ll connect an AI app and choose what it may do.

00:00:11.628 --> 00:00:22.615
In Claude or ChatGPT, add a custom connector with your workspace address, followed by slash M C P. Sign in to Worklynq, and this screen asks what the app may do.

00:00:23.638 --> 00:00:34.731
Reading is always included. Untick editing tickets, docs, dashboards, or your shifts to keep it read-only, then click Allow. It works as you, and never sees more than you can.

00:00:35.758 --> 00:00:47.513
Tools on your computer, like Claude Code and Cursor, use a personal A P I token. Create one on the API tokens page, then Connect your agent shows the exact setup to copy.

00:00:48.536 --> 00:00:59.885
Connected apps are listed here too: disconnect one at any time. Your System Admin can turn every token and app off at once, and everything they do shows in the agent activity log.
